# Skills and verify

Read the skill file before using the tool. Do not substitute a different model, host, or API.

| When | Load |
|---|---|
| Stripe | Stripe skills + `user-stripe` MCP. Live FILTER HERO only. |
| Klaviyo | Parked in `archive/klaviyo` (FH-369). Do not call the Klaviyo MCP unless restoring |
| Railway | Railway skill / CLI. One service. `DATA_DIR=/data`. |
| Supabase | Supabase skill + hosted MCP. No `supabase start`. |
| DNS / Turnstile | `docs/CLOUDFLARE-NAMESERVERS.md`. Not Hostinger. |
| Higgsfield | Higgsfield skill + `user-higgsfield`. GPT Image 2 / Seedance 2.0. |
| Storefront check | Playwright. Click the flow. |
| Firecrawl / Tavily | Research only. Forbidden as Filter King catalog source. |
| Apify | `apify` subagent first if named. Not the Filter King catalog path. |

Verify: `pnpm verify:store` · `verify:crm` · `verify:account` · `verify:supabase` · `verify:security` · `verify:env` · `verify:resend` · `verify:stripe-books` · `verify:intuit-oauth` · `pnpm smoke`.

Secrets never go in `VITE_` vars except `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY`, `VITE_SITE_URL`, `VITE_FULL_CATALOG`.
